      "cardHtml": "\n\n<article class=\"content-card\">\n  \n  \n  <div class=\"card-meta\"><span>Nonfiction</span><span>Fujian</span></div>\n  <h3><a href=\"/xiangyin-client/en/content/item-38fd0e70ddf24be4/\">方言中的“实用主义者”</a></h3>\n  \n  \n  \n  <p>尽管L出生在北京，她自幼和福州的爷爷奶奶生活。而在福州的还有她的一大家子人：叔叔、婶婶、表哥表妹...她热爱着脚下的这片土地。</p>\n  <a class=\"text-link card-link\" href=\"/xiangyin-client/en/content/item-38fd0e70ddf24be4/\">Read the article<span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a>\n</article>\n"
