      "cardHtml": "\n\n<article class=\"content-card has-cover media-row\">\n  <a class=\"card-art\" href=\"/xiangyin-client/en/content/item-f97c85257d1f49c6/\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"/xiangyin-client/en/assets/attachments/1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n  \n  <div class=\"card-meta\"><span>Dialect in media · Dialect music</span><span>Chongqing</span><span>Original platform</span></div>\n  <h3><a href=\"/xiangyin-client/en/content/item-f97c85257d1f49c6/\">重庆方言音乐：王齐铭</a></h3>\n  \n  \n  \n  <p>2025年10月，他发表了专辑《生活麻辣烫》。专辑中，他用重庆方言生动地描述重庆充满烟火气的市井生活：以小镇青年为视角的故乡记忆被他全部写进歌内。</p>\n  <a class=\"text-link card-link\" href=\"/xiangyin-client/en/content/item-f97c85257d1f49c6/\">Explore the work<span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a>\n</article>\n"
