      "contentsHtml": "\n\n<section class=\"region-group\" data-region-group=\"media\" aria-labelledby=\"panel-group-media\">\n  <div class=\"group-heading\"><h3 id=\"panel-group-media\">Media works</h3><a href=\"/xiangyin-client/en/regions/hunan/?kind=media\">All 2 items <span aria-hidden=\"true\">›</span></a></div>\n  \n\n<article class=\"content-card region-card mini-card has-cover\" data-content-id=\"item-2bdc61b7c5334b5c\">\n  <a class=\"card-art card-thumb\" href=\"/xiangyin-client/en/content/item-2bdc61b7c5334b5c/?from=%2Fxiangyin-client%2Fen%2F%3Fregion%3Dhunan%23region-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"/xiangyin-client/en/assets/attachments/7.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n  <div class=\"card-copy\"><div class=\"card-meta\"><span>Dialect in media · Dialect music</span><span>Hunan</span><span>Original platform</span></div>\n  <h4><a data-title href=\"/xiangyin-client/en/content/item-2bdc61b7c5334b5c/?from=%2Fxiangyin-client%2Fen%2F%3Fregion%3Dhunan%23region-panel\">湖南方言音乐：C-Block</a></h4>\n  <p data-summary>在运用大量武侠小说的素材的同时，也保留了本土的地域特色。《江湖流》被收录在《以下犯上》这张专辑，为C-Block彻底走向大众视野留下坚实的基础。</p>\n  <a class=\"text-link card-link\" data-link href=\"/xiangyin-client/en/content/item-2bdc61b7c5334b5c/?from=%2Fxiangyin-client%2Fen%2F%3Fregion%3Dhunan%23region-panel\">Explore the work <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div>\n</article>\n\n\n<article class=\"content-card region-card mini-card has-cover\" data-content-id=\"item-b2c3672a26c14a0a\">\n  <a class=\"card-art card-thumb\" href=\"/xiangyin-client/en/content/item-b2c3672a26c14a0a/?from=%2Fxiangyin-client%2Fen%2F%3Fregion%3Dhunan%23region-panel\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><img src=\"/xiangyin-client/en/assets/attachments/5.jpeg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n  <div class=\"card-copy\"><div class=\"card-meta\"><span>Dialect in media · Dialect music</span><span>Hunan</span><span>Original platform</span></div>\n  <h4><a data-title href=\"/xiangyin-client/en/content/item-b2c3672a26c14a0a/?from=%2Fxiangyin-client%2Fen%2F%3Fregion%3Dhunan%23region-panel\">湖南方言音乐：C-Block</a></h4>\n  <p data-summary>他们全程用长沙话演唱的《长沙策长沙》爆火。这首歌用大量长沙俚语描绘了长沙的市井生活，将长沙这个充满烟火气的城市带入大众的视野。</p>\n  <a class=\"text-link card-link\" data-link href=\"/xiangyin-client/en/content/item-b2c3672a26c14a0a/?from=%2Fxiangyin-client%2Fen%2F%3Fregion%3Dhunan%23region-panel\">Explore the work <span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div>\n</article>\n\n</section>\n\n\n"
